('Unemployment among tech-exposed workers aged 20-30 rose about 3 points since early 2025 (Goldman).','workers aged 20 to 30 in tech','Not fetched. '+U,[]),
('Klarna replaced 700 customer service workers with AI, quality fell, it rehired humans; its "CAO" said people want people.','Klarna\nreplaced 700 customer service workers','KLA: in 2024 Klarna said its AI assistant did the work of 700 agents. It did not announce 700 layoffs (headcount fell via attrition). In 2025 CEO Siemiatkowski (not a "CAO") acknowledged lower quality and resumed human hiring. Partly correct, misframed.',['KLA']),
